{
  "item": [
    {
      "id": "2a516574-d22b-4521-9443-f4042f106e2a",
      "name": "Media Items",
      "description": {
        "content": "When sending messages via the SimpleTexting platform, you may need to attach various media items. This API allows you to perform various operations needed to manage your media attachments. The size limitations of these items are discussed [here](#tag/File-Information).",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
      "item": [
        {
          "id": "fdb2a90f-6518-4585-83a1-82cd3f7cd4d0",
          "name": "Upload Media",
          "request": {
            "name": "Upload Media",
            "description": {
              "content": "Upload a media file from a local directory to SimpleTexting.\n\n**Example:** Here we upload an image from our local directory using an HTTP request. We state that the media should be shared with teammates:\n\n`POST /api/mediaitems/upload?shared=true HTTP/1.1 Host: https://api-app2.simpletexting.com/v2/ accept: */* Authorization: Bearer {{YOUR_TOKEN}} Content-Length: 176 Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW ----WebKitFormBound`",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "api",
                "mediaitems",
                "upload"
              ],
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "shared",
                  "value": "true",
                  "description": "Define whether a media file is shared with teammates"
                }
              ],
              "variable": []
            },
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "multipart/form-data"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "method": "POST",
            "auth": null,
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                {
                  "key": "file",
                  "type": "file",
                  "description": "(Required) The media file you want to upload"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "id": "af070d09-d135-460d-99e9-066dd1b230cf",
              "name": "Success. Media is uploaded.",
              "originalRequest": {
                "url": {
                  "path": [
                    "api",
                    "mediaitems",
                    "upload"
                  ],
                  "host": [
                    "{{baseUrl}}"
                  ],
                  "query": [
                    {
                      "key": "shared",
                      "value": "false"
                    }
                  ],
                  "variable": []
                },
                "header": [
